{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_055_ddpm-title\">DDPM</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">预设离散高斯前向链，加训练稳定的 epsilon/score 网络，再按学习到的随机逆链逐步采样。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Defines a fixed discrete Markov Gaussian forward noising chain and trains a noise-prediction U-Net (ε_θ) across all noise scales for iterative reverse sampling.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">训练时的干净样本 x0；生成时的高斯噪声 xT</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Clean training image x_0 (during training); pure Gaussian noise x_T ~ N(0,I) (during sampling)</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">经 T 步随机逆扩散得到的样本 x0_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Sample x̂_0 synthesized via T iterative stochastic reverse denoising steps</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.2</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://papers.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2020/hash/4c5bcfec8584af0d967f1ab10179ca4b-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_055_ddpm')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_055_ddpm')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"DDPM original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/06139c7552ac4cb9d086.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.2</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_055_ddpm\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_055_ddpm')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_055_ddpm\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">数据 x0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x0</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">训练分布中的干净图像</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests clean training image x_0 (during training); pure gaussian noise x_t ~ n(0,i) (during sampling) and prepares initial tensor representations (x0).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"训练分布中的干净图像\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests clean training image x_0 (during training); pure gaussian noise x_t ~ n(0,i) (during sampling) and prepares initial tensor representations (x0).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"数据 x0\" data-node-name-en=\"x0\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">数据 x0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x0</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练分布中的干净图像</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests clean training image x_0 (during training); pure gaussian noise x_t ~ n(0,i) (during sampling) and prepares initial tensor representations (x0).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"q(x_t|x_{t-1}) 逐步加入预设方差的高斯噪声\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"前向 q\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 02\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">前向 q</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 02</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">q(x_t|x_{t-1}) 逐步加入预设方差的高斯噪声</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Stage 02 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"重参数化 x_t=sqrt(alpha_bar_t)x0+sqrt(1-alpha_bar_t)epsilon\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs noise epsilon within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"噪声 epsilon\" data-node-name-en=\"noise epsilon\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">噪声 epsilon</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise epsilon</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">重参数化 x_t=sqrt(alpha_bar_t)x0+sqrt(1-alpha_bar_t)epsilon</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs noise epsilon within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"t 越大越接近标准高斯，x_T 作为生成起点\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs noise x_t within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"噪声状态 x_t\" data-node-name-en=\"noise x_t\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">噪声状态 x_t</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise x_t</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">t 越大越接近标准高斯，x_T 作为生成起点</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs noise x_t within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"正弦/学习嵌入条件化去噪网络\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 05 within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"时间 t\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 05\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">时间 t</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 05</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">正弦/学习嵌入条件化去噪网络</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 05 within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"网络预测 epsilon_theta；等价 score s_theta=-epsilon_theta/sigma_t\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs epsilon / score within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"epsilon / score\" data-node-name-en=\"epsilon / score\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>epsilon / score</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">网络预测 epsilon_theta；等价 score s_theta=-epsilon_theta/sigma_t</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs epsilon / score within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"由 epsilon_theta 参数化 p(x_{t-1}|x_t) 的均值并注入随机噪声\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs p_theta within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"逆转移 p_theta\" data-node-name-en=\"p_theta\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">逆转移 p_theta</span><span class=\"lang-en\">p_theta</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">由 epsilon_theta 参数化 p(x_{t-1}|x_t) 的均值并注入随机噪声</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs p_theta within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"x_T→...→x_0，原始 DDPM 需要数百至千步\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 08 within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"T 步随机链\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 08\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">T 步随机链</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 08</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">x_T→...→x_0，原始 DDPM 需要数百至千步</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 08 within the core discrete diffusion computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"原始 DDPM 不使用 ODE；后续可由对应 score 构造 probability-flow ODE\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"ODE 路径\" data-node-name-en=\"ODE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">ODE 路径</span><span class=\"lang-en\">ODE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">原始 DDPM 不使用 ODE；后续可由对应 score 构造 probability-flow ODE</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies ODE to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"最终 x0_hat\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces sample x̂_0 synthesized via t iterative stochastic reverse denoising steps via Synthesized Sample.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"生成样本\" data-node-name-en=\"Synthesized Sample\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_055_ddpm', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成样本</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Synthesized Sample</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">最终 x0_hat</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces sample x̂_0 synthesized via t iterative stochastic reverse denoising steps via Synthesized Sample.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"DDPM Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · DDPM 闭式加噪与 epsilon 预测目标</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Closed-Form Forward Gaussian Marginals &amp; Noise-Prediction Variational Bound Simplification</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"DDPM：核心公式 · DDPM 闭式加噪与 epsilon 预测目标\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"55\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"13.012678pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.279199 -68.453307 232.191233 13.012678\" width=\"232.191233pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.967701 11.35468V11.106545H2.094264C1.846128 11.106545 1.637694 10.937813 1.637694 10.689677V.099254C1.637694-.148881 1.846128-.317613 2.094264-.317613H2.967701V-.555824H.873437V11.35468H2.967701Z\" id=\"m055_g5-2\"></path><path d=\"M2.431728 11.35468V-.555824H.337464V-.317613H1.210901C1.459037-.317613 1.667471-.148881 1.667471 .099254V10.689677C1.667471 10.937813 1.459037 11.106545 1.210901 11.106545H.337464V11.35468H2.431728Z\" id=\"m055_g5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7.56317-.555824H6.97757L4.446588 9.359671L2.501206 5.220771L.595525 6.233164L.71463 6.441597L1.77665 6.044581L4.387036 11.513487L7.56317-.555824Z\" id=\"m055_g5-112\"></path><path d=\"M1.854863-.797012L1.74618-.84773C1.35492-.39126 1.231745-.275331 1.101325-.275331C.992642-.275331 .934677-.362278 .978151-.45647L1.651988-2.85475H2.347561L2.383789-3.101099H1.717198L1.905582-3.847392L1.833127-3.956075H1.81139C1.782408-3.956075 1.74618-3.934339 1.717198-3.890865C1.412884-3.