-67\" y=\"-58.675779\"></use><use x=\"147.349564\" xlink:href=\"#m055_g8-186\" y=\"-58.675779\"></use><use x=\"151.663373\" xlink:href=\"#m055_g8-107\" y=\"-58.675779\"></use><use x=\"156.146559\" xlink:href=\"#m055_g21-50\" y=\"-62.790339\"></use><use x=\"156.146559\" xlink:href=\"#m055_g21-50\" y=\"-55.649636\"></use><use x=\"160.480306\" xlink:href=\"#m055_g5-3\" y=\"-66.795309\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">GAN min-max 训练不稳、mode coverage 差，VAE 高频模糊</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">GANs suffered from adversarial instability and mode dropping, while likelihood-based flows and VAEs struggled with sample sharpness.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">通过逐步高斯加噪并训练网络在各噪声尺度预测噪声来生成数据</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Destroy data structure gradually via a fixed Gaussian diffusion process and learn the reverse Markov transition via stable multi-scale L2 noise regression.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">稳定的多噪声尺度监督回归与可解释逆扩散链</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Re-weighted ε-prediction objective + time-conditioned U-Net achieving stable optimization and high mode coverage.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">成为医学重建、生成、去噪和跨模态 diffusion 的基础</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Foundational prior for medical image synthesis, counterfactual generation, denoising, and diffusion-based inverse problem solvers.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">生成建模基础设施；原始数百至千步采样不适合常规部署</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Core generative infrastructure; standard 1,000-step ancestral sampling is too slow for real-time clinical workflows without acceleration.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">固定前向高斯链把复杂数据分布平滑到简单噪声，学习任务被分解为多个噪声尺度的回归。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">噪声预测与 score 估计只差已知尺度因子，因此可用于构造逆向生成动力学。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">原始高质量来自细粒度随机逆链，代价是大量网络评估；ODE 不是原论文的主采样路径。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Destroy data structure gradually via a fixed Gaussian diffusion process and learn the reverse Markov transition via stable multi-scale L2 noise regression.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Re-weighted ε-prediction objective + time-conditioned U-Net achieving stable optimization and high mode coverage.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Closed-Form Forward Gaussian Marginals &amp; Noise-Prediction Variational Bound Simplification.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">是医学图像合成、重建先验、去噪和跨模态生成的基础，但部署延迟通常需要加速采样器。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">生成质量不能证明患者级事实保真；罕见病灶、设备域移位和不确定性校准需独立验证。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Foundational prior for medical image synthesis, counterfactual generation, denoising, and diffusion-based inverse problem solvers.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Core generative infrastructure; standard 1,000-step ancestral sampling is too slow for real-time clinical workflows without acceleration.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://papers.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2020/hash/4c5bcfec8584af0d967f1ab10179ca4b-Abstract.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>Denoising Diffusion Probabilistic Models</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/hojonathanho/diffusion\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
